 that you contact your doctor before consuming our product<\/p>"}},"menu_b9yTA8":{"type":"menu","settings":{"title":"HOW MUCH CAFFEINE IS IN PERFORM?","text":"<p>PERFORM has 60 mg of natural caffeine. That is much less than a cup of coffee.<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["menu_MfDeMh","menu_BQ4yLj","menu_wakDBw","menu_YKrywd","menu_b9yTA8"],"disabled":true,"settings":{"color_scheme":"scheme-2","padding_top":0,"padding_bottom":0,"heading":"frequently asked questions","content":"<p>We're here to address any concerns or queries you may have to help you make an informed decision.<\/p>","heading_size":"h0"}}},"order":["main","product_ingreadients_yrtcTf","hilighted_text_pVik4U","two_images_UEtTqr","image_with_text_Hmami6","video_KfbGw4","point_table_HhRVLG","discover_wGCgTk","1743200211f5770a77","straight_customers_YqmXDU","related-products","faqs_GMgTWi"]}